    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373960/extras/269f5e3fce3c1bd4de0f45d35a259dfb.avif?t=1742974116\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Hololive temporary office on the 8th floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing work, I was about to get on the elevator and go down to the first floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, once I got on the elevator and when the door opened again, I realized I was back on the 8th floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how many times I take the elevator, I always get taken off on the 8th floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I looked inside the elevator, I found a notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you notice anomaly, get on the red elevator.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you can't find anomaly, take the blue elevator.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAim for the first floor.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I decided to follow the instructions in order to escape from this office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape from the office</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the looping office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape from the office</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you notice anomaly, get on the red elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't find anomaly, take the blue elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the first floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than 70 Hololive member appear! !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373960/extras/8e045353aae73a2ea1c3eb42082d8929.avif?t=1742974116\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 70 Hololive members from Hololive JP, ID, EN, and DEV_IS will appear in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hololive members may surprise you or hide to avoid being seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 100 anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 100 anomalies in the office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many anomalies will appear, including ones related to Hololive members and things in the office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the office carefully and make sure you don't miss any unusual changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Anomaly Mode&quot; and &quot;Everyday Mode&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose the mode to play according to your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Anomaly Mode&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty: Normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror effects available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game over effects available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the original atmosphere of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Everyday Mode&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty: Easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror effect None</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game over effect None</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Hololive members will appear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of the game are the same as (Anomaly mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*To discover all the anomalies, you need to play two modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did they decide to move to a temporary office? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you after you escape? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what is the truth hidden in the temporary office? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various mysteries are hidden inside the office. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's uncover all the truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Contents (bonus movie)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373960/extras/9f03c5a6d268e7095486b0798d3b515a.poster.avif?t=1742974116\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373960/extras/9f03c5a6d268e7095486b0798d3b515a.webm?t=1742974116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373960/extras/9f03c5a6d268e7095486b0798d3b515a.mp4?t=1742974116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find many anomalies, a bonus movie limited to this game will be released! !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movies of Hololive members appearing in this game will be released, so</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can watch the movie anytime!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for anomaly ideas! !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373960/extras/a495750d2aa468681d156acb9f31c136.avif?t=1742974116\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are looking for anomaly ideas that you would like to see appear in this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are looking for ideas for various types of anomalies, such as cute anomaly, horror anomaly, gag anomaly, etc.!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomaly you came up with may appear in the game! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the QR code in the image for details! !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is published under CCMC Corp(\u203b1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(\u203b2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.</p>",
